{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2336", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2336/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2336/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2336/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2336", "id": 2337975193, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s6LWquZ", "number": 2336, "title": "mavsdk_server can't discover system ", "user": {"login": "Hmilzy", "id": 95394680, "node_id": "U_kgDOBa-beA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95394680?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Hmilzy", "html_url": "https://github.com/Hmilzy", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Hmilzy/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Hmilzy/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Hmilzy/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Hmilzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Hmilzy/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Hmilzy/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Hmilzy/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Hmilzy/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Hmilzy/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977272, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNzI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/question", "name": "question", "color": "cc317c", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2024-06-06T11:03:23Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-06T08:08:49Z", "closed_at": "2025-05-06T08:08:47Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hello !\r\nI have a raspiberry pi ,  it linked with Pixhawk 6X throught serial.           rapi: serial0 -> ttyAMA0\r\nI have set some parameters using QGC like this : \r\n1. MAV_1_CONFIG = TELE 2\r\n2. MAV_1_MODE = Onboard\r\n3. MAV_1_RATE = 5000\r\n4. MAV_1_FORWARD = Disabled\r\n5. SER_TEL2_BAUD = 921600\r\n\r\n\r\nFirmware Version : 1.14.0\r\nmavsdk_server Verson: 1.4.17\r\n\r\nI deploy mavsdk_server in raspi, but it seems not discover mav_system. Do you have any advices ? Thank you !\r\n\r\n./mavsdk_server_linux-arm64-musl -p 50040 serial:///dev/ttyAMA0:921600\r\n\r\n![b9d785a6595bc75e329e92fbda739ec](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/assets/95394680/c481967b-e4cf-406c-8f98-5b323d5d3390)\r\n\r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/